    "description_html": "<p>Elevate your brand with our Oval Name Badges designed to combine vibrant full-color printing with durability and customization. Perfect for businesses, events, and organizations, these name badges offer a professional and polished look.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Full Custom Color Printing</strong>: Enjoy vibrant, full-color printing of logos and text, ensuring your brand stands out.</li>\n<li><strong>Pin or Magnetic Fastener</strong>: Choose between pin or magnetic fasteners for easy attachment and versatility.</li>\n<li><strong>Scratch and Fade-Proof Coating</strong>: Our badges feature a durable polyurethane coating that protects against scratches and fading, ensuring they look great for a long time.</li>\n<li><strong>Rapid Production Times</strong>: Benefit from quick turnaround times, ensuring you receive your badges promptly.</li>\n<li><strong>No Setup Fees &amp; No Design Fees</strong>: Start your order without any additional setup or design costs.</li>\n<li><strong>Free Doming</strong>: Enhance the look of your badges with free doming, adding a glossy and professional finish.</li>\n<li><strong>No Minimums</strong>: Order as many or as few as you need, with no minimum order requirements.</li>\n<li><strong>No Hidden Fees</strong>: Enjoy transparent pricing with no hidden charges.</li>\n<li><strong>Quantity-Based Prices</strong>: Enjoy competitive pricing with discounts based on order quantity.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Order Your Oval Name Badge Today!</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Make a lasting impression with vibrant, durable, and customizable name badges. Perfect for businesses, events, and organizations, these badges offer a professional look with the added benefit of durability. Click the \"Buy Now\" button and elevate your brand with our Shaped Name Badges &amp; Oval Name Tags!</p>"
  },
  "assumptions": [
    "Decoration (engraved or printed) comes from the BigCommerce custom field dp_engraved.",
